  ],
  "strategy": "Mishra, Eminent One makes a hasty 4/4 token copy of a noncreature artifact at the start of each combat, and the deck is built to feed and sacrifice artifacts. Servo Schematic, Mycosynth Wellspring, Ichor Wellspring, Farid, Enterprising Salvager and Oni-Cult Anvil turn every artifact that leaves into a token, a card or damage; Ashnod the Uncaring copies each ability paid for with a sacrifice, and Smelting Vat, Audacious Reshapers and Slobad, Goblin Tinkerer turn spare artifacts into bigger ones or keep the best ones alive. Mirrorworks, Lithoform Engine, Strionic Resonator and Machine God's Effigy copy what is already working, Metalwork Colossus and Blast-Furnace Hellkite close the game, and Executioner's Capsule, Chaos Warp, Bedevil, Blasphemous Act and Terisiare's Devastation answer what the artifacts cannot.",
